  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $4$th row of $U$ by the $1$st column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}_{41} & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 10 \\\\ -3 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 10 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 20 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =(-5)\\cdot (-2)+3\\cdot (-1)+10\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =10-3-10 \\\\  & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
